WEBVTT

00:00:08,880 --> 00:00:15,840
but how can we manage daily pain without having to take Tylenol or leave your ad bill or any over the

00:00:15,840 --> 00:00:26,000
counter? Artica cream helps a little but what else might be helpful? So we've addressed this

00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:32,720
because pain can be an issue with people with cancer, right? So how do you address pain from a

00:00:32,720 --> 00:00:38,560
natural perspective? Well there are things like artica creams, there are artica things that you could

00:00:38,560 --> 00:00:45,200
take orally, you could take artica as an herb orally or you could take artica folio path orally.

00:00:45,200 --> 00:00:53,520
Now they tend to be helpful with minor pain issues. Also you could think of anything that's not that

00:00:53,520 --> 00:01:04,480
as an anti-inflammatory, like your flavonoids, like the curcumid, the Vazuela, the resveratrol,

00:01:04,480 --> 00:01:12,880
the EGCG, from green tea extract, the white willow bark, any of the other barks,

00:01:13,520 --> 00:01:21,200
um of course it did. Those can be helpful but again mainly for more minor pain.

00:01:24,560 --> 00:01:30,960
There isn't going to be, you know, anything from a natural perspective that's really going to

00:01:31,760 --> 00:01:42,240
work as quickly as a pain medication. The only other thing that I would suggest is maybe thinking

00:01:42,240 --> 00:01:51,520
of the marijuana product. CBD really doesn't, isn't a pain reducer. It can help with inflammation

00:01:51,520 --> 00:01:58,720
that's in the brain maybe but not elsewhere. THC is the psychoactive for a marijuana

00:01:59,760 --> 00:02:07,360
and that has been shown to be helpful with pain. However it has other side effects, not many people

00:02:07,360 --> 00:02:15,840
like feeling loopy but it can help with pain at night because you're going to sleep anyhow. So

00:02:15,840 --> 00:02:24,640
taking a THC product prior to sleep, maybe an hour before bed, it can help a person fall asleep,

00:02:24,640 --> 00:02:31,360
it can help a person stay asleep and it can help a person stay asleep if they wake up because of

00:02:31,360 --> 00:02:37,040
pain so it can help decrease pain and help a person get through the night. But most people don't

00:02:37,040 --> 00:02:43,920
like to take the THC products during the day because you feel kind of loopy and out of it and nobody

00:02:43,920 --> 00:02:51,760
likes that I don't like to feel that way. So um but from a natural perspective there are a lot of

00:02:51,760 --> 00:03:02,320
things that are going to touch pain like a non-steroidal anti-inflammatory or prescription medication

00:03:02,320 --> 00:03:04,400
unfortunately.

